{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55245","headline":"题洪阳洞 · 胡徽","name":"题洪阳洞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天窗通月影，地穴通江津。\n（见《舆地纪胜》卷二八《袁州》。\n）（按：《欧阳文忠公文集》卷三四《赠太子太傅胡公墓志》云胡宿之祖名徽，推其时，亦约爲五代末人，疑即本诗作者。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡徽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55245.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55245","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}